{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"余端"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"余端"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>余端是"},{"Local":{"url":"端","text":"端"}},{"Plain":"的对偶概念, 可理解为"},{"Local":{"url":"加权余极限","text":"加权余极限"}},{"Plain":", 它是 “函数对测度积分” 的类比与"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴化","text":"范畴化"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>作为余极限</h3>\n<p>函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal{D}$ 的余端是以"},{"Local":{"url":"扭箭头范畴","text":"扭箭头范畴"}},{"Plain":"为指标的"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\int_{\\mathcal C} F = \\operatorname{colim}_{(X\\to Y)\\in\\mathsf{TwArr}(\\mathcal C)} F(X,Y).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>上式的一种计算方式是如下的"},{"Local":{"url":"余等化子","text":"余等化子"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\int_{\\mathcal{C}}F = \\operatorname{coeq}\\Big(\r\n    \\coprod_{X\\to Y} F(X,Y) \\rightrightarrows \\coprod_{X}F(X,X)\r\n\\Big).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>与 Hom 及加权余极限的关系</h3>\n<p>由余端出发的 Hom 可转换为 Hom 的"},{"Local":{"url":"端","text":"端"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n&amp;\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}\\Big(\\int_{\\mathcal C}F(-,-),d\\Big) \\\\\r\n&amp;\\simeq\r\n\\operatorname{lim}_{(X\\to Y)\\in\\mathsf{TwArr}(\\mathcal C)}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(X,Y),d)\\\\\r\n&amp;\\simeq \\int^*_{\\mathcal C}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(-,-),d).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>. 函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal{D}$ 的余端等于以 $\\operatorname{Hom}$ 函子为权的"},{"Local":{"url":"加权余极限","text":"加权余极限"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\int_{\\mathcal C} F = \\operatorname{colim}^{\\operatorname{Hom}}F.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>.\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n&amp;{\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}}{\\Big(\r\n    \\int_{\\mathcal C}F,d\\Big)}\\\\\r\n    &amp;\\simeq\r\n    \\int_{\\mathcal C}^*\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(-,-),d)\\\\\r\n    &amp;\\simeq\r\n    \\int^*_{(X,Y)\\in\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C}\\operatorname{Hom}(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y),\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(X,Y),d))\\\\\r\n    &amp;\\simeq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(\\operatorname{colim}^{\\operatorname{Hom}}F,d)\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>代函子的复合</h3>\n<p>参见"},{"Local":{"url":"代函子","text":"代函子"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>与测度积分的类比</h3>\n<p>对于函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to \\mathcal{V}$, $G\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathcal{V}$, 余端\n$$\r\n\\int_{c\\in\\mathcal C} F(c) \\times G(c)\r\n$$\n可视为可测空间上的函数对测度积分的类比或"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴化","text":"范畴化"}},{"Plain":", 其中 $F$ 是 “被积函数”, $G$ 是 “测度”.\n这个余端也可理解为"},{"Local":{"url":"代函子","text":"代函子"}},{"Plain":" $F\\colon 1\\to \\mathcal C$ 与 $G\\colon \\mathcal C\\to 1$ 的复合, 也即"},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴上的模","text":"模"}},{"Plain":"的张量积.</p>\n<p><strong>例</strong>. 在 $\\mathcal V = \\mathsf{Ani}$ 情形, 关于常值函子 $G = 1$ 的 “积分”\n$$\r\n\\int_{c\\in\\mathcal C}F(c)\r\n$$\n就是函子 $F$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":"; 一般地余端可理解为"},{"Local":{"url":"加权余极限","text":"加权余极限"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><strong>例</strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"可表函子","text":"可表函子"}},{"Plain":" $G = \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,X)$ 是 “$\\delta$-分布” 的类比,\n$$\r\n\\int_{c\\in \\mathcal C} F(c) \\times \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,X) \\simeq F(X).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}